ed feedback programmes for debut authors.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <p>&copy; 2026 Tania Vorster. All rights reserved.</p>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
