  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and built the complete brand website for Tania Vorster, integrating the Style Analyst tool directly into the platform structure. The application strictly adheres to the provided UK English language rules, aesthetic guidelines, and architectural constraints.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Zero-Framework Architecture**: Built the entire frontend using standalone HTML files, one shared `styles.css`, and vanilla JavaScript to ensure maximum structural clarity and performance.\n- **Brand Visual Identity**: Implemented the precise color palette\342\200\224anchored by the high-contrast `#442B63` primary purple\342\200\224paired with the Outfit and DM Sans typography scale to ensure WCAG AA contrast compliance across all breakpoints.\n- **Style Analyst Tool**: Designed the core style guide generator on the root page. The tool securely transmits user-provided writing samples to a backend endpoint (`server.ts`) where the Gemini AI constructs a comprehensive style guide detailing narrative rhythm, cadence patterns, and point-of-view mechanics. \n- **Page Implementation**: Mapped and implemented all requested pages sequentially (`index.html`, `about.html`, `work-history.html`, `education.html`, and `contact.html`).\n- **GHL Integration Framework**: Configured the contact page to house the requested GoHighLevel (GHL) iframe embed, strictly avoiding the creation of custom HTML contact forms."
    thinking: "**Assessing Functional Conformity**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the app\'s functionality aligns with Tania Vorster\'s design principles. The implementation adheres to the specified clean aesthetic, UK English, and color palette. Notably, I\'ve ensured strict adherence to these principles, particularly regarding the use of custom HTML forms, which are intentionally limited to the main AI interface.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and built the complete brand website for Tania Vorster, integrating the Style Analyst tool directly into the platform structure. The application strictly adheres to the provided UK English language rules, aesthetic guidelines, and architectural constraints.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Zero-Framework Architecture**: Built the entire frontend using standalone HTML files, one shared `styles.css`, and vanilla JavaScript to ensure maximum structural clarity and performance.\n- **Brand Visual Identity**: Implemented the precise color palette\342\200\224anchored by the high-contrast `#442B63` primary purple\342\200\224paired with the Outfit and DM Sans typography scale to ensure WCAG AA contrast compliance across all breakpoints.\n- **Style Analyst Tool**: Designed the core style guide generator on the root page. The tool securely transmits user-provided writing samples to a backend endpoint (`server.ts`) where the Gemini AI constructs a comprehensive style guide detailing narrative rhythm, cadence patterns, and point-of-view mechanics. \n- **Page Implementation**: Mapped and implemented all requested pages sequentially (`index.html`, `about.html`, `work-history.html`, `education.html`, and `contact.html`).\n- **GHL Integration Framework**: Configured the contact page to house the requested GoHighLevel (GHL) iframe embed, strictly avoiding the creation of custom HTML contact forms."
